          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: On October 7, 1976, several teenagers observed for a few seconds around 7 PM (19:00) the rapid passage of an object over the houses in the neighborhood. The object was described as having the shape of a red cigar and moving silently on a trajectory from southeast to northwest. No adults witnessed this phenomenon, which was reported in the local press on the insistence of one of the parents. These children likely observed the passage of an aircraft, as air traffic is significant in this area near Metz Airport.",
